#import "@preview/verseatile:0.2.1": poem

== In passing

#poem[][

I saw Jesus at the bus stop\
Had he been waiting long

I saw Jesus at the bus stop\
We were minding our own business

I saw Jesus light a cigarette\
Before he puts it to his lips\
Our bus arrives

I saw Jesus turn to look at me\
He says I learned that one from you

My fingers in my pocket\
Brushing prayer rope knots

I want to say I learned so much from you\
But no words sound\
Perhaps it isn't true

I saw Jesus tilt his head at me\
Silly boy, it's as true as\
Anything that was and could and will be

And don't smoke

I saw Jesus at the bus stop\
He got on the crosstown\
And I will have to catch the next one

